  "description": "After barely waking up from a coma caused by a car accident, Lark is in despair when he learns he can no longer dance. Lark resents Sadin for the car accident and leaves the academy where he danced for years, resolving to start a new live. After a difficult day, Lark's ex-boyfriend Kwai comes to visit him.\n\nBut what? The car accident wasn't caused by Sadin?\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
